   "name": "PartReel Library",
   "description": "Open, no-login KiCad parts: symbols + footprints, gate-verified with datasheet provenance.",
   "description_full": "PartReel's curated library: self-generated, quality-gated symbols and footprints with datasheet-sourced dimensions.\nEvery part passes automated gates (structure, KiCad Library Convention drawing rules, render completeness, anti-copy provenance check against the official library) before release.\nSymbols carry footprint assignment, datasheet link, description and search keywords, so placing a part brings its footprint along.\nThis package contains 453 parts. The full catalog (21,000+ parts, no login) lives at https://partreel.com",
